items.title:
io.github.doriangrelu:openapi-contract-generator 0.1.0 发布, Boots a server-less Spring context, registers a documentation-only proxy per
        @ApiContract interface, groups them by @ApiDomain and writes one OpenAPI 3.1
        document per domain. Consumed in test scope by API contract modules.

